      "text": "End of 1st half: Rockets 73, Wizards 54 Thompson 19 pts, 5 rebs, 4 assts Durant 16 pts (5-8 FG) Sengun 9 pts, 4 rebs, 4 assts Spectacular half of offense from the Rockets. They shot 56.5 percent from the floor, 10-20 on 3s, 19 assists and 5 turnovers. Amen Thompson played maybe",
